<!--
  24/7 RESTAURANT EQUIPMENT — Q4 VIRTUAL LAUNCH PARTY LANDING PAGE
  ==================================================================
  HOW TO USE IN SHOPIFY:
  1. Shopify Admin → Online Store → Pages → Add page
  2. Title it "Fourth Quarter Launch Party" (or similar) — note the URL handle it generates
  3. In the page editor, switch the content area to HTML mode (</> icon) and paste
     everything below the "PASTE STARTS HERE" line
     — OR, for more control, create a page.launch-party.liquid template in
     Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Templates, paste this in, and assign
     that template to the page from the page editor's "Theme template" dropdown.
  4. Publish, then link to it from your main nav / homepage banner / emails.

  PLACEHOLDERS TO REPLACE BEFORE GOING LIVE:
  - [ECO BURNER TOPIC] — fill in once confirmed
  - [VENDOR LOGO URLs] — swap in actual vendor logo image URLs (or delete the
    <img> tags and just use the text card style if logos aren't ready)
  - Confirm event time (currently set to 10:00 AM ET per the StreamYard preview)
-->

